SUMMARY:Greenwood North - Intermediate
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nJoin us for a hike at Greenwood North!\n\n
 We will hike at a moderate pace for 8 kms in just under 2 hours hrs.\n\nTh
 e trail weaves throughout the forest and returns along a river. There will
  be lots of twists and turns and ups and downs with exposed roots along an
  established mountain bike trail.\n\nPlease bring sturdy hiking boots or s
 hoes\, and 1L of water.\n\nPlease also be aware of ticks. bring bug spray 
 and dress appropriately.\n\nWe are going to meet at the Greenwood Conserva
 tion entrance off Concession 5. [https://goo.gl/maps/1sPgxE71j8VrcWrg9](ht
 tps://goo.gl/maps/1sPgxE71j8VrcWrg9).\nHope to see you there!\n\n**Note**\
 n• Arrive on time! Don't let the group wait for you.\n• Know your limi
 ts! Hike within it!\n• Dress for the conditions.\n• Free Parking\n• 
 The hike will be canceled if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\n***Hike lea
 ves promptly at 9:35 AM***\n\nHope to see you there!\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER
  AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if 
 applicable)\, you are confirming that you have read\, understand and accep
 t the following:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group. Attending eve
 nts is voluntary by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us
  is at your own risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to i
 ndemnify and hold harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant orga
 nizers\, event hosts\, and other members from all claims or liability of e
 very type (including court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to an
 y person or for damage to property\, loss of personal property or any othe
 r wrongful act arising out of or relating to your participation as a membe
 r. This agreement applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who
  may accompany you in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the orga
 nizers as well as other group members harmless. By participating voluntari
 ly in the group\, you expressly waive any and all such claims against each
  and every other member in the group\, including without limitation any an
 d all claims against the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organ
 izers\, and event hosts.
